graph TD
    A[User Query: Business Desc] --> B{Intelligence General}
    B --> C[KBLI Captain: Search]
    C --> D[Qdrant: Hybrid Search]
    D --> E[Refine: Sparse + Dense]
    E --> F{SDV: Deterministic Check}
    F -- Valid --> G[Final KBLI Proposal]
    F -- Invalid --> H[Error: Rework Prompt]
    G --> I[Episodic Memory: Save Success]
    H --> J[Episodic Memory: Save Failure]
    I --> K[Value Flow: Trigger Visa Captain]
    K --> L[Visa Captain: Start Plan]

